PART–1 : Route53 Hybrid DNS (Deep Notes)
=========================================

Hybrid DNS म्हणजे On-Premise Network + AWS VPC मधील DNS Integration.
हे AWS मध्ये Route53 Resolver Inbound & Outbound Endpoints वापरून achieve होते.

⭐ 1. Hybrid DNS – What / Why?
👉 समस्या:

On-prem servers ला AWS VPC मधील services resolve करता येत नाही.

AWS EC2 ला on-prem DNS records resolve करता येत नाहीत.

👉 Solution:

AWS Route53 → Resolver Endpoints:

Inbound Endpoint → On-prem → AWS

Outbound Endpoint → AWS → On-prem

⭐ 2. DNS Inbound Endpoint (Deep Explanation)
🔹 वापर:

On-prem servers AWS VPC मधील Private DNS resolve करण्यासाठी.

Example:

On-prem server:

db.dev.aws.local → resolve inside AWS

कसे काम करते?

On-premises DNS Server → forward rule → Route53 Resolver Inbound Endpoint → VPC’s DNS resolver

डायग्राम:
On-Prem DNS → Resolver Inbound → AWS VPC

Inbound Endpoint Requirements:

✔ ENIs created in 2 subnets
✔ Security groups allow UDP/TCP 53
✔ On-prem firewall allows DNS traffic

⭐ 3. DNS Outbound Endpoint (Deep Explanation)
वापर:

AWS EC2 machine ला On-prem DNS resolve करण्यासाठी.

Example:

AWS EC2:

corp.local → on-prem DNS server

कसे काम करते?

EC2 → Route53 Resolver → Outbound Endpoint → On-prem DNS server

डायग्राम:
AWS EC2 → Resolver Outbound → On-Prem DNS Server

Requirements:

✔ On-prem DNS IP whitelisted
✔ VPC to on-prem connectivity (VPN / DX)

⭐ 4. Cleaning Up Hybrid DNS

Delete in order:

Resolver Rules

Outbound Endpoint

Inbound Endpoint

Hosted Zone

ENI cleanup

