⭐ 4. What is Read Replica? (Deep Explanation)

Read Replica = copy of database used ONLY for reads.

Use Cases:

High read workload

Reporting queries

Analytics

Offloading read traffic from primary DB

Support:

MySQL

PostgreSQL

MariaDB

Aurora

Creation:

RDS → Actions → Create Read Replica

Traffic Split Example:

Primary → Writes

Replica → Reads

⭐ 5. Multi-AZ in RDS

Multi-AZ = High Availability
Primary DB + Standby DB (different AZ)

Failover events:

Primary failure

Patch

AZ outage

✔ Automatic failover
✔ Sync replication
✔ No data loss

⭐ 6. What is RDS Proxy?

RDS Proxy = Connection pooling + efficient DB connectivity layer.

Why use Proxy?

Apps create many DB connections → DB overload

Proxy maintains connection pool

Apps connect to Proxy, Proxy connects to DB

Benefits:

✔ Fast failover
✔ Reduced connection storms
✔ Better performance
✔ Secure (Secrets Manager integration)

