=========================================
Interview Questions (ALL RDS Topics)
=========================================
Q1: RDS आणि Aurora मध्ये फरक?

Aurora = AWS optimized, performance 5× MySQL, 3× Postgres.

Q2: Read Replica कशासाठी वापरतात?

Read-heavy workloads scale करण्यासाठी.

Q3: Multi-AZ vs Read Replica?

Multi-AZ → high availability

Read Replica → read scalability

Q4: RDS Proxy का वापरतात?

Connection pooling, fast failover, fewer DB connections.

Q5: Aurora Writer आणि Reader endpoint फरक?

Writer = Read + Write

Reader = Read only (auto load balanced)

Q6: Parameter group म्हणजे काय?

Database configuration values store करणारा template.

Q7: Cross Region Read Replica कधी वापरतात?

Disaster Recovery आणि multi-region read traffic साठी.

Q8: RDS मध्ये scaling कसे होते?

Vertical scaling (instance type)

Horizontal (read replicas)

Q9: Aurora मध्ये storage कसे काम करते?

Shared storage layer, 6 copies across 3 AZs.

Q10: RDS deletion protection म्हणजे काय?

Accidental delete होऊ नये म्हणून lock.

